     6	accepted_at: 2026-04-24
     7	accepted_via: Round-19 sentinel (84a4977 promote) + applied at Phase 8 v1.10.0 tag decision + PLAN-058 Round-23 frontmatter flip (F-CR-02 residual closure)
     8	proposed_by: CEO + VP Engineering (PLAN-051 Phase 2.5)
     9	related_plans: [PLAN-051]
    10	related_adrs: [ADR-070, ADR-071, ADR-007]
    11	blast_radius: L3-wide (irreversible tag push semantics, npm registry impact)
