   108	
   109	      # rail round-2 F4 — the baseline-manifest suite (ADR-155 C.2-C.7).
   110	      # Measured S327: `grep -r test_install_baseline_manifest.sh .github/` = 0.
   111	      # It is the ONLY check that observes what install and upgrade RECORD as
   112	      # framework-owned — the C.8 assertions the PLAN-183 W5 patch adds for the
   113	      # docs/ + .github/ delivery records live here, and nothing was running
   114	      # them. Wired HERE and not in smoke-install.yml on purpose: ~11-15 min of
   115	      # real install/upgrade legs locally, i.e. 22-45 CI minutes at this org's
   116	      # 2-3x runner factor, on top of a per-PR job already budgeted at 58 —
