   121	      # Darwin arm64, 692 s): 32 passed / 1 failed, the failure being C.6.2
   122	      # "root PROTOCOL.md NOT backed up without a manifest" — PRE-EXISTING and
   123	      # not this wave's (the W5 patch adds 95 lines to that file and touches
   124	      # ZERO C.6 lines). Wiring it as a plain `bash ...` would paint this
   125	      # workflow red every night for a defect it did not cause, which is how a
