   104	      # -----------------------------------------------------------------
   105	      # PLAN-166 W1 item 2 (F3, ADR-155-AMEND-1 §5, Forma A (ii)) — the
   106	      # framework version marker `.claude/.framework-version` is a TRACKED
   107	      # one-line file, byte-identical to VERSION (the version bump writes
   108	      # it as a site; verify-counts.sh cross-checks it). This assert is
   109	      # deliberately UNCONDITIONAL and fail-closed: a missing marker in a
   110	      # release checkout means the ceremony that introduced it was
