   649	      - name: Verify owner.asc populated
   650	        # Session 75 Codex Finding 1 closure: prior workflow imported
   651	        # `.claude/trust/owner.asc` without validating it carries a real
   652	        # PGP block. Empty file silently no-ops `gpg --import` and the
   653	        # subsequent `git tag --verify` could fall through. Fail-closed
   654	        # gate ensures the trust anchor is populated before the import.
