   673	      # ==========================================================
   674	      # PLAN-081 Phase 6-bis — Pair-Rail verdict gate (step 15)
   675	      # ==========================================================
   676	      # R1 S-Sec-3 (replay defense) + R1 S-Sec-4 (deterministic inputs_hash)
   677	      # + R1 C5 (Codex CLI pin enforcement) + R1 S-QA-Unseen-2 (distinct
   678	      # VERDICT_EXPIRED exit code) + R1 S-CR-Unseen-6 (explicit "step 15 runs
   679	      # after steps 1-14" ordering).
   680	      #
   681	      # S104 redesign: verdict.commit_sha → verdict.parent_sha.
   682	      # The legacy commit_sha bind was an unsolvable self-reference
   683	      # (verdict file cannot declare its own commit SHA — the SHA is only
   684	      # known AFTER the verdict commit lands). v1.16.0 GA bridged via
   685	      # CEO_PAIR_RAIL_VERDICT_OPTIONAL=1 transition mode. The replacement
   686	      # binds to parent_sha — the commit the verdict was generated
   687	      # against (parent of the verdict-file commit). That value is
   688	      # observable + immutable when the verdict is authored.
   689	      #
   690	      # Step 15 asserts:
   691	      #   - verdict.parent_sha == git log -n1 --format=%H -- <verdict-file>^
   692	      #   - verdict.release_tag == ${GITHUB_REF_NAME}  (replay defense)
   693	      #   - verdict.tool_versions.codex_cli in codex-cli-pin.txt range
   694	      #   - verdict.tool_versions.codex_payload_sha256 (+ codex_target_triple)
   695	      #     == codex-cli-pin-manifest.json payloads[<triple>].sha256
   696	      #     (ADR-182 payload pin — the sha of the NATIVE codex payload,
